OL,3,GNEWSAPFAS-linked fertiliser used in 111
OL,4,Afields
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government has published a list of
OL,7,Fmore than 100 fields where a fertiliser
OL,8,Flinked to forever chemicals was spread
OL,9,Fin 2024 and 2025.
OL,11,FBiosolids are used by farmers but there
OL,12,Fis a growing concern by experts about
OL,13,Fthe presence of PFAS, also known as
OL,14,Fforever chemicals, in the fertiliser.
OL,16,FJersey Infrastructure Minister Jonathan
OL,17,FRenouf, who published the list which
OL,18,Fhad 111 fields on it, said scientific
OL,19,Ftests showed there was no PFAS
OL,20,Fcontamination in the fields where the
OL,21,Fbiosolids were used.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
