OL,3,GNEWSAPFAS-linked fertiliser used in 111
OL,4,Afields
OL,5,
OL,6,FPFAS were present in firefighting foam
OL,7,Fused at the airport fire training
OL,8,Fground in the early 1990s and leaked
OL,9,Finto the neighbouring area and private
OL,10,Fborehole water supplies.
